{"c":[{"id":"8b70e773b2fa893f","sum":"Caret.xcodeproj: Info.plist is B100…62, B100…57 is TabCompletions; never give Info.plist 57. Screenpipe 0.4.50 /search 403s without Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY (/health is open); Caret _api sent SCREENPIPE_API_KEY only if set.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T192920Z-0329343e8c4345de","text":"Current Caret.xcodeproj: Info.plist is B100…62; B100…57 is TabCompletions. Do not assign Info.plist 57.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T193615Z-bae439ab3f2c08e5","text":"Screenpipe 0.4.50 /search 403s without Bearer SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY; /health is open. Caret _api only sent SCREENPIPE_API_KEY if set.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0394a3f3d78f5601","sum":"Router tests advance a fake clock past the 10 s failure backoff; Caret last-N sends Bearer plus X-Screenpipe-Client: api with the token from SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY, SCREENPIPE_API_KEY, or screenpipe's own.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260919T193745Z-b26ffd587de72a56","text":"Router backs off RouterConfig.failure_backoff_seconds (10s) after a failed evaluation; router tests advance a fake clock rather than expecting an immediate retry. Provider presets patch their own module's post_json in tests.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260919T193825Z-36390ce7b0d562a4","text":"Caret last-N sends Bearer plus X-Screenpipe-Client: api; token from SCREENPIPE_LOCAL_API_KEY, SCREENPIPE_API_KEY, or pinned screenpipe auth token.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
